abstract: >
  This repository contains a fully reproducible geospatial analysis of
  Global Horizontal Irradiance (GHI) across Reunion Island, including
  raster preprocessing, spatial distribution mapping and extraction of
  optimal solar zones for solar cooking applications. This software provides a reproducible Python workflow for analysing Global Horizontal Irradiance (GHI) over Reunion Island, including raster preprocessing, spatial mapping and extraction of high solar-potential zones. It was developed as part of a Master's thesis at Université Paris-Saclay.

